when you get it. It is half flood now, and high water in 2h24.\"","important":true,"lat":38.5771,"lon":-9.3504},{"t":1657609200,"date":"12 July 1482","time":"07h00","kind":"navigation","text":"Ran the coast in sight all forenoon. It is on the Lisbon chart, but on it the way a thing is when nobody who drew it had been there — a line copied from a line. It is ours now, with a pilot’s name against it.","important":false,"lat":38.5771,"lon":-9.3504},{"t":1657627200,"date":"12 July 1482","time":"12h00","kind":"navigation","text":"Noon. 31 miles made good in the 6 hours since she sailed, latitude 38° 15.2' N by the reckoning. 483 miles still to run for Funchal.","important":false,"lat":38.2531,"lon":-9.6834},{"t":1657634400,"date":"12 July 1482","time":"14h00","kind":"note","text":"The water has changed colour: greener than it was, and the lead finds a bottom.","important":false,"lat":38.1138,"lon":-9.8208},{"t":1657713600,"date":"13 July 1482","time":"12h00","kind":"navigation","text":"Noon. 131 miles made good in the twenty-four hours, latitude 36° 35.4' N by the reckoning. A fair day’s work. 356 miles still to run for Funchal.","important":false,"lat":36.5899,"lon":-11.3917},{"t":1657735200,"date":"13 July 1482","time":"18h00","kind":"note","text":"Dusk bell. the pilot's doubt has grown to 30 miles. The clock is down to four times.","important":false,"lat":36.1857,"lon":-11.7953},{"t":1657800000,"date":"14 July 1482","time":"12h00","kind":"navigation","text":"Noon. 122 miles made good in the twenty-four hours, latitude 35° 05.7' N by the reckoning. A fair day’s work. 240 miles still to run for Funchal.","important":false,"lat":35.0957,"lon":-12.9762}],"finance":{"credit":{"marchionni":30,"lomellini":12,"affaitati":20,"sernigi":42,"cambista":60},"debts":[],"borrowed":0,"repaid":0,"sharedOut":0,"defaults":0,"nextId":1},"propositionsSeen":[],"feitorias":[],"lettersSeen":[],"dockedAt":null,"dockedSinceT":0,"anchored":false,"ration":1,"pumpEffort":0.15,"autoTrim":true,"diff